        "content": "## HL · Forget old chats\nLesson 4.3. Daily clean-up: deletes chat memory rows older than 30 days.\n\n**Credential:** Postgres (the same one the agent's memory uses).\n\nCheck your table's columns first (Supabase table editor). n8n's memory table may have no timestamp column: if so, add one before relying on this:\nALTER TABLE hl_chat_memory ADD COLUMN created_at timestamptz DEFAULT now();",
